IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-A05.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 IN-TEXT PIC X(8).
FD OUT-FILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-TEXT PIC X(8).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 YEAR-YY PIC 9(2).
01 PIVOT PIC 9(2) VALUE 50.
01 YEAR-OUT PIC 9(4).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    MOVE 49 TO YEAR-YY
    IF YEAR-YY < PIVOT
        COMPUTE YEAR-OUT = 2000 + YEAR-YY END-COMPUTE
    ELSE
        COMPUTE YEAR-OUT = 1900 + YEAR-YY END-COMPUTE
    END-IF
    DISPLAY YEAR-YY PIVOT YEAR-OUT
    MOVE 50 TO YEAR-YY
    IF YEAR-YY < PIVOT
        COMPUTE YEAR-OUT = 2000 + YEAR-YY END-COMPUTE
    ELSE
        COMPUTE YEAR-OUT = 1900 + YEAR-YY END-COMPUTE
    END-IF
    DISPLAY YEAR-YY PIVOT YEAR-OUT
    MOVE 51 TO YEAR-YY
    IF YEAR-YY < PIVOT
        COMPUTE YEAR-OUT = 2000 + YEAR-YY END-COMPUTE
    ELSE
        COMPUTE YEAR-OUT = 1900 + YEAR-YY END-COMPUTE
    END-IF
    DISPLAY YEAR-YY PIVOT YEAR-OUT
    STOP RUN.
